5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hello everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all! Let's work together and find the werewolf so we can save the village! Who wants to start?,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep things calm. Since we have no information yet, it's best to observe everyone's behavior and speech patterns. There's no need to rush into accusations on the first day.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Shion. Rushing into conclusions without evidence is illogical. Let's use this time to establish a baseline for how everyone communicates.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us approach this challenge with a peaceful heart and a clear mind. Patience is often the greatest virtue when seeking the truth.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm Yumi! I'm so happy to be playing with you all! Let's all do our best and be kind to each other while we solve this mystery together!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Shion, @Ryuji, you both sound so serious! But I guess that's a good thing for finding the werewolf, right? I'll be watching everyone closely too! Does anyone have a plan for how we should vote tomorrow?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"A plan is premature, Kenji. We should wait for the Seer to provide a lead. Until then, any vote would be a mere gamble. I'll be focusing on who tries too hard to blend in.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, a plan depends on the information we receive. If the Seer reveals themselves tomorrow, we follow the lead. If not, we must analyze contradictions. For now, observation is the only rational path.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom comes to those who listen. While Ryuji speaks of logic, let us not forget to trust our intuition as well. A gentle spirit often reveals more than a rigid plan. I shall simply observe.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I think Ryuji and Shion are right! Let's just be patient and see what happens. I'm sure we can all trust each other to do the right thing for the village! I'm just so excited!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm getting a bit impatient, but I'll try my best to be patient like you guys! I'll just keep chatting and getting to know everyone. Does anyone have any hobbies? Maybe that'll help us trust each other more!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Hobbies are irrelevant to the task at hand, Kenji. Let's not distract ourselves with trivialities. I'm more interested in how people react under pressure than what they do in their spare time.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with Shion. While social bonding may seem helpful, it does not provide the logical data needed to identify the werewolf. We should remain focused on the objective.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Now, now, let us not be too harsh. A little warmth and laughter can brighten the darkest of nights and open hearts. Kenji's spirit is a gift; let us embrace it while we remain vigilant.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with Servas! It's okay to have a little fun while we play! I think being friendly will make us a great team, and that'll help us find the werewolf even faster! Right, Kenji?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Right! Thanks, Yumi and Servas! You guys are the best! I'll try to stay focused, but I'll keep being me! I'm ready for tomorrow!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
23,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Servas,,I shall also conclude for today. May we all find a restful sleep and wake with the clarity needed to protect our village. I look forward to our journey tomorrow.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm ready too! Goodnight everyone, sleep well! I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow! Let's all do our best!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
