33,1,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
34,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Everyone, wake up! I have some really important news! I'm the Seer, and I checked Shion last night. It turns out Shion is the werewolf! We have to be careful, but I'm sure of it!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"That is a remarkably bold claim for the first turn, Kenji. To reveal yourself as the Seer so instantly is either an act of extreme desperation or a clumsy attempt by the werewolf to frame me.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, claiming the Seer role immediately is a high-risk strategy. If you are the werewolf, you've just identified your target. If you are the Seer, you've made yourself a target. I need to evaluate the probability of both.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Servas,,"My dear friends, let us breathe and remain calm. Such a sudden revelation can be startling, but let us listen to both sides with an open heart. Kenji, your confidence is striking; Shion, your caution is wise.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Wow, Kenji! You found the werewolf already?! That's amazing! But @Shion, you sound really worried. I hope there isn't a big fight! What should we do? I trust you both!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not lying, I promise! I really did check Shion, and the result was clear! @Ryuji, I know it's risky, but if we don't vote Shion out now, the werewolf might attack someone tonight! We have to act fast!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your urgency is a classic tell. By pushing for an immediate execution, you're attempting to bypass our critical thinking. If you were truly the Seer, you'd understand that a calculated approach is safer for the village.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, urgency does not equate to truth. @Shion, your point about the werewolf bypassing our critical thinking is valid. If Kenji is the werewolf, he is attempting to eliminate a perceived threat quickly. I am still analyzing the situation.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a delicate balance we must strike. While Kenji's passion is a beacon of energy, Shion's logic is a steady anchor. Let us not let haste cloud our judgment; the truth often reveals itself in the quiet spaces between arguments.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I really don't want anyone to be sad, but if Kenji is the Seer, we have to listen to him to save the village! But Shion is so calm... this is so hard! What do you think, Ryuji?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Ryuji, please believe me! I'm just a kid, but I'm telling the truth! Shion is the werewolf! If we let them stay, they'll just keep lying to us and hurt more people! We can't wait any longer!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, appealing to your age is a pathetic attempt to manipulate our emotions. It's a transparent tactic. @Ryuji, you've noticed the pattern. The werewolf is panicking because they've chosen a target who won't be intimidated. Logic dictates we question the accuser.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, emotional appeals are not evidence. @Shion, your composure is consistent, but that can also be a mask. However, Kenji's haste to execute on day one is highly suspicious. I am leaning toward the possibility that Kenji is the werewolf.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Servas,,"The tide of the conversation is shifting, and it is a heavy burden to bear. Ryuji, your analytical mind sees a pattern, and Shion, your resolve is firm. Let us remember that truth is not always loud, nor is silence always innocence. What say you, Yumi?","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shion"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm really torn! Kenji seems so sincere, and I hate to think he's lying, but Ryuji is so smart and logical. If Ryuji thinks Kenji is suspicious, maybe we should be careful? I just want us all to be safe!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Please, please believe me! I'm not trying to manipulate anyone, I'm just scared for all of you! Shion is the werewolf, I saw it! If you vote for me, the werewolf wins! Please, let's just trust the Seer!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The time for pleading is over, Kenji. Your desperation has only served to confirm your guilt. By attempting to paint me as a monster, you've revealed your own nature. Ryuji, Servas, Yumi—let us be rational. The werewolf is right here.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji"",""Servas"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The evidence is insufficient to be certain, but the behavioral patterns are telling. Kenji's reliance on emotion and urgency is a common trait of a werewolf attempting to force a mistake. I believe Kenji is the werewolf. I vote for Kenji.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a sorrowful day when we must cast doubt upon one of our own. Kenji, your heart is full of fire, but Ryuji's reason is a steady light. I believe we must follow the path of logic today. I vote for Kenji.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no, this is so sad! I really wanted to believe Kenji, but Ryuji and Servas are so sure... I don't want to make a mistake, but I have to do what's best for everyone. I'll vote for Kenji too.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
