66,2,1,talk,Shion,,"It seems our suspicions were correct. Kenji's desperation was his undoing. However, the loss of Ryuji is a significant blow to our logical capacity. We must now determine if the werewolf is still among us or if Kenji was merely a Possessed player.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Servas,,It is a heavy morning indeed. We have lost two of our companions in a single night. Ryuji's departure leaves a void of reason that we must all strive to fill with courage and clarity. Let us hold onto hope.,"{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"I can't believe Ryuji is gone! This is so scary... I'm so sorry, Ryuji! Now there are only three of us left. Shion, Servas, we have to be really careful now so we can find the werewolf together!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shion"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Yumi, panic will only cloud your judgment. We must be cold and precise. Since Ryuji was attacked, it confirms the werewolf is still active. Either Servas or you is the enemy, or Kenji was a lone wolf and the Possessed is now leading the charge.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Ryuji"",""Servas"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Servas,,"My dear Shion, while your precision is admirable, let us not let the coldness of logic freeze our hearts. We are few now, and fear is a shadow that grows when we stop supporting one another. Let us speak with honesty and kindness.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm trying my best to stay calm, Shion! I really want to help! But it's so scary to think that one of us might be the werewolf... I trust you and Servas, I really do! Please, let's just figure this out together!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Servas, your insistence on kindness is a convenient shield. In a game of deception, the one who most loudly advocates for ""trust"" and ""open hearts"" is often the one hiding the most. Yumi, your blind trust is a liability. We must analyze the facts.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Your words are sharp, Shion, but a shield of kindness is not meant to hide the truth; it is meant to protect the spirit while we seek it. Suspicion is a heavy cloak that can blind us to the light of innocence. Let us look deeper.","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, please don't be so mean to Servas! He's just trying to keep us positive! I know it's scary, but if we just keep fighting and suspecting each other, the werewolf wins! We have to trust each other to win!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Shion,,"Trust is a luxury we cannot afford, Yumi. If we trust the wrong person, the game ends tonight. Servas, your poetic diversions are becoming tedious. If you are not the werewolf, then you are the Possessed, protecting the wolf. I'll vote for you.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Servas,,"It is a sorrowful conclusion to reach, Shion, but I accept your scrutiny with a peaceful heart. If my faith in humanity seems a diversion to you, it is only because I believe that love is the only truth that endures. I vote for Shion.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"Wait, please don't fight! Shion, Servas, we're all that's left! If we just vote based on who's being ""tedious"" or ""too kind,"" we might make a huge mistake! I don't want to lose anyone else! I'll vote for Shion... only because I'm so scared!","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
